   "summary": "The law amended section 112a of title 1 to require the Department of State to make unpublished copies of certain international agreements and qualifying non-binding instruments available on request, and it struck the prior subsections in that section [2023-117-263-112a-1] [2023-117-263-112a-2]. It also rewrote section 112b of title 1 to require monthly written reports to congressional leaders and committees on international agreements and qualifying non-binding instruments, and it changed the section heading to \"United States international agreements and non-binding instruments; transparency provisions\" [2023-117-263-112b-1] [2023-117-263-112b-h1].",
